    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say stuff like that to be nice but it feels so fake. it's not just \"settling in\" anymore. it's been months. i go to the same cafe, the same grocery store, and i'm just a ghost. if i didn't show up tomorrow, i dont think a single person in this city would even blink. it feels like the world is just moving on without me and maybe it's supposed to be that way.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
